    "scene_type": "zonk_diagram",
    "source_ids": [
     "S1"
    ],
    "spoken": "Which direction? The sun decides. On the comb, the angle to vertical shows the angle to the sun. Food 60 degrees left of the sun: a run 60 degrees left of vertical. No hands, so I point with my leaf.",
